---
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Interactive software-only observatory for QuotientOdometer privacy accounting."/><title>QuotientOdometer Studio</title></head>
<body><main id="qo-studio" class="qo-shell">
<nav><a href="/">NOTICER / <b>QO</b></a><span>ADAPTIVE PRIVACY ACCOUNTING OBSERVATORY</span><small>SOFTWARE-ONLY · SYNTHETIC TRACE</small></nav>
<header><div><p>QUOTIENTODOMETER STUDIO / K10</p><h1>Watch privacy<br/><em>become state.</em></h1></div><aside>Every permitted action spends from a shared horizon. Scrub the trace to see the filter decide before release, survive a crash, invalidate stale evidence, and seal each transition into a receipt chain.</aside></header>
<section class="qo-scenarios" aria-label="Scenarios"><button class="active" data-scenario="nominal">01 NOMINAL</button><button data-scenario="coalition">02 COALITION</button><button data-scenario="crash">03 CRASH / RECOVER</button><button data-scenario="invalidation">04 INVALIDATION</button><button id="qo-play" class="play">▶ PLAY TRACE</button></section>
<section class="qo-grid">
<article class="qo-stage"><div class="qo-label">ACTION TIMELINE <b id="qo-position">1 / 12</b></div><div id="qo-timeline" class="qo-timeline"></div><input id="qo-scrubber" type="range" min="0" max="11" value="0"/>
<div class="qo-flow"><div><small>REQUEST</small><strong id="qo-action">NOTIFY</strong><span id="qo-service">svc-1</span></div><i>→</i><div class="core"><small>PRE-RELEASE FILTER</small><strong id="qo-decision" class="qo-decision release">RELEASE</strong><span id="qo-event">conditional profile composed</span></div><i>→</i><div><small>PUBLIC TRACE</small><strong>ACTION ONLY</strong><span>no private evidence</span></div></div>
<div class="qo-budget"><div class="qo-budget-head"><span>PRIVACY HORIZON</span><strong><b id="qo-spent">0</b> / <b id="qo-budget">72</b></strong></div><div class="qo-meter"><i id="qo-budget-fill"></i><span>SAFE</span><span>FILTER</span></div></div></article>
<aside class="qo-rail"><article><small>COALITION SCOPE</small><strong id="qo-coalition">C:{1}</strong><p>Joint observation is charged to the active coalition, never only to marginal services.</p></article><article><small>PROFILE EPOCH</small><strong id="qo-profile" class="valid">VALID</strong><p>Policy changes invalidate certified profiles before the next release.</p></article><article class="counts"><div><small>RELEASED</small><b id="qo-release-count">0</b></div><div><small>REJECTED</small><b id="qo-reject-count">0</b></div></article></aside>
</section>
<section class="qo-receipt"><div><p>CRASH-CONSISTENT RECEIPT CHAIN</p><h2 id="qo-chain-status">CHAIN VERIFIED</h2></div><div class="chain"><span><small>PREVIOUS</small><code id="qo-previous">GENESIS</code></span><i>→ H(event ∥ state ∥ prev) →</i><span><small>CURRENT</small><code id="qo-receipt">--------</code></span></div></section>
<footer><span>Candidate research system · bounded explanatory surface</span><span>Generated artifacts are not committed · no biosignal enters this demo</span></footer>
<script>import { bootstrapOdometerStudio } from "../scripts/quotient-odometer/studio"; const root=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#qo-studio"); if(root) bootstrapOdometerStudio(root);</script>
</main></body></html>
<style>
:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#071613;color:#eaf3df}.qo-shell{--acid:#d8ff57;--orange:#ff6b35;--ink:#071613;--paper:#eaf3df;--teal:#123c35;min-height:100vh;padding:0 clamp(18px,4vw,70px) 30px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,#205c4b 0,transparent 27%),linear-gradient(120deg,#071613 0 68%,#0b211c 68%);font-family:"Cascadia Mono","Courier New",monospace}nav{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;border-bottom:1px solid #628078;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.15em}nav a{color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none;font-weight:900}nav b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acid);color:var(--ink)}nav small{margin-left:auto;color:#8ba69d}header{min-height:310px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr .5fr;align-items:end;padding:50px 0}header p,.qo-receipt p{color:var(--acid);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.18em}h1{margin:15px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(3.8rem,8vw,8rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.78}h1 em{color:var(--orange);font-weight:400}header aside{padding:20px;border-left:2px solid var(--orange);font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.55;color:#bed0c7}.qo-scenarios{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-bottom:10px}.qo-scenarios button{padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #49665f;background:transparent;color:#9bb0aa;font:700 .64rem inherit;letter-spacing:.08em;cursor:pointer}.qo-scenarios button.active{background:var(--acid);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--acid)}.qo-scenarios .play{margin-left:auto;background:var(--orange);border-color:var(--orange);color:white}.qo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 270px;gap:10px}.qo-stage{padding:28px;border:1px solid #49665f;background:#e8eee2;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:10px 10px 0 #ff6b3540}.qo-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.qo-timeline{height:88px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;margin-top:10px}.qo-tick{position:relative;flex:1;height:40px;border:0;border-top:2px solid #8ca097;background:transparent;color:#566b64;cursor:pointer}.qo-tick i{position:absolute;top:-7px;left:50%;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#3f7566}.qo-tick.reject i{background:var(--orange)}.qo-tick.recover i{background:#1e5fd7}.qo-tick.active i{transform:scale(1.8);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #d8ff5799}.qo-tick span{position:absolute;top:13px;left:45%;font-size:.6rem}.qo-stage input{width:100%;accent-color:var(--orange)}.qo-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 30px 1.35fr 30px 1fr;align-items:center;margin:34px 0;text-align:center}.qo-flow>div{min-height:120px;padding:24px 12px;border:1px solid #839a91}.qo-flow .core{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border:0}.qo-flow small,.qo-rail small,.chain small{display:block;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#73867f}.qo-flow strong{display:block;margin:16px 0 8px;font-size:1.05rem}.qo-flow span{font-size:.68rem}.qo-decision.release{color:var(--acid)}.qo-decision.reject{color:var(--orange)}.qo-decision.recover{color:#69a0ff}.qo-budget-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.68rem}.qo-budget-head strong{font-size:1.3rem}.qo-meter{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;height:28px;margin-top:10px;padding:7px;background:#b7c3bc;font-size:.55rem;overflow:hidden}.qo-meter i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:var(--fill);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3f7566,var(--acid),var(--orange));transition:width .35s}.qo-meter span{z-index:1}.qo-rail{display:grid;gap:10px}.qo-rail article{padding:22px;border:1px solid #49665f;background:#0c2621}.qo-rail strong{display:block;margin:12px 0;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--acid)}.qo-rail strong.invalid{color:var(--orange)}.qo-rail p{color:#91aaa1;font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.5}.qo-rail .counts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.counts b{font-size:2rem}.qo-receipt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1fr;align-items:center;margin-top:20px;padding:25px;border:1px solid #49665f;background:#0c2621}.qo-receipt h2{margin:8px 0;color:var(--acid);font-family:Georgia,serif}.chain{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:18px}.chain span{padding:12px;border:1px solid #49665f}.chain code{display:block;margin-top:8px;color:var(--acid)}.chain i{color:var(--orange);font-size:.7rem}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:25px;color:#789087;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.08em}@media(max-width:850px){header,.qo-grid,.qo-receipt{grid-template-columns:1fr}.qo-scenarios{flex-wrap:wrap}.qo-scenarios .play{margin-left:0}.qo-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.qo-flow>i{transform:rotate(90deg)}.chain{justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}nav>span{display:none}footer{gap:15px}}
</style>
